d model selection via `selectModel()`\n\n**Domain Schemas**: `src/modules/ai/domain/schemas/`\n- Base schemas: `BaseTextInputSchema`, `BasePromptSchema`, `BaseExternalContextSchema`\n- Tool-specific schemas: `ParaphraseInputSchema`, `SummarizeInputSchema`, etc.\n- Enum schemas: `ToneSchema`, `TargetAudienceSchema`, `ExternalContextTypeSchema`\n\n## **Pattern: Flow Definition & Export**\n\nAll 38+ flows (in `src/modules/ai/infrastructure/flows/`) follow this pattern:\n```typescript\n// Flow definition (unexported)\nconst myFlow = ai.defineFlow(\n  { name: \'tool-name\', inputSchema: InputSchema, outputSchema: OutputSchema },\n  async (input: InputType) => { /* implementation */ }\n);\n\n// Export async wrapper (required for \'use server\' files)\nexport async function toolNameWrapper(input: InputType) {\n  return myFlow(input);\n}\n```\n\n## **Directory Structure**\n\n```\nsrc/modules/ai/\n├── adapters/\n│   ├── api-client/\n│   │   ├── WritingToolsApiClient.ts\n│   │   ├── AgentApiClient.ts\n│   │   └── GenerationLogApiClient.ts\n│   ├── controllers/\n│   │   └── AiController.ts\n│   ├── hooks/\n│   │   ├── writing-tools/\n│   │   │   ├── use-writing-tool.ts (main hook)\n│   │   │   ├── use-paraphraser-logic.ts\n│   │   │   └── ... (35+ tool-specific hooks)\n│   │   └── use-agent-categories.ts\n│   └── components/\n│       ├── writing-tools/\n│       │   ├── WritingToolsPanel.tsx\n│       │   ├── WritingToolsDashboard.tsx\n│       │   └── ... (35+ tool components)\n│       └── admin/, agent/, sidebar/\n├── application/\n│   ├── services/\n│   │   ├── WritingToolRegistry.ts (main registry)\n│   │   └── tool-providers/\n│   │       ├── WritingToolProvider.ts\n│   │       ├── AcademicToolProvider.ts\n│   │       └── GenerationToolProvider.ts\n│   └── use-cases/\n│       ├── RunAiToolUseCase.ts (central orchestrator)\n│       ├── GetAgentsUseCase.ts\n│       └── ... (6+ use cases)\n├── domain/\n│   ├── schemas/\n│   │   ├── index.ts (barrel export)\n│   │   ├── base-schemas.ts\n│   │   ├── flows.ts\n│   │   └── ... (5+ schema files)\n│   ├── services/\n│   │   ├── IAiService.ts (interface)\n│   │   └── IRetrievalService.ts\n│   ├── repositories/\n│   │   ├── IGenerationLogRepository.ts\n│   │   └── IAgentRepository.ts\n│   ├── entities/\n│   │   ├── Agent.ts\n│   │   └── Diagram.ts\n│   ├── errors/\n│   │   └── AiErrors.ts\n│   ├── constants/\n│   │   └── AiModels.ts\n│   └── utils/\n│       ├── ai-utils.ts\n│       ├── json-output-validator.ts\n│       ├── plantuml-utils.ts\n│       └── TokenManager.ts\n└── infrastructure/\n    ├── flows/\n    │   ├── index.ts (barrel with 38 exports)\n    │   ├── __tests__/\n    │   │   ├── summarize-text.test.ts\n    │   │   └── generate-report-section.test.ts\n    │   ├── academic/ (9 flows)\n    │   ├── analysis/ (8 flows)\n    │   ├── document/ (8 flows)\n    │   ├── generation/ (16 flows)\n    │   ├── media/ (3 flows)\n    │   └── writing/ (8 flows)\n    ├── services/\n    │   ├── Genkit.ts (instance + model constants)\n    │   ├── GenkitAiService.ts (main AI service)\n    │   ├── model-selector.ts\n    │   ├── model-request-queue.ts\n    │   ├── model-performance-monitor.ts\n    │   └── model-health-check.ts\n    ├── repositories/\n    │   ├── SQLiteGenerationLogRepository.ts\n    │   └── SQLiteAgentRepository.ts\n    ├── prompts/\n    │   ├── index.ts\n    │   ├── General.ts\n    │   └── ... (3+ prompt files)\n    └── tools/\n        ├── schemas.ts\n        ├── citations-and-references.ts\n        └── ... (7+ tool definition files)\n```\n\n## **Test Example**\n\n`src/modules/ai/infrastructure/flows/__tests__/summarize-text.test.ts` demonstrates flow testing:\n- Mocks `ai.definePrompt()` and `ai.defineFlow()`\n- Tests schema validation, empty input errors, enum validation\n- Verifies prompt parameters and result handling\n\n---\n\n**Key Integration Points:**\n1. **Guest/Free access**: `isFreeForGuests` flag + `rateLimiter` (5/day guests, 10/day registered free users)\n2. **Credit system**: Pre-deduction with refund on failure\n3. **Model fallback**: Automatic retry chain if primary model fails\n4. **Output cleanup**: Removes "Sure, here is..." conversational filler from small models\n5. **Logging**: Every generation logged with input/output/credits for auditing\n</summary>\n</subagent_invocation>'}
