2026-04-03 04:10:21.023 | 9969  (9969) | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": {"plan": "# Clean Architecture Alignment Plan\n\nThis plan aims to align the `ai` module and related infrastructure with the project's Clean Architecture standards, focusing on the Result Object Pattern, AI model centralization, and Next.js 15 compliance.\n\n## 1. Result Object Pattern Enforcement\n- **Refactor Call Sites**: Scan and update all instances where `Result.value` or `Result._value` is accessed directly. Replace with `.getValue()` after verifying `.isSuccess`.\n- **API Response Consistency**: Ensure all routes in `src/app/api/agents/` and other AI-related endpoints consistently use `handleAiResult` or the appropriate domain-specific handler from `api-utils.ts`.\n\n## 2. AI Model Centralization\n- **Replace Hardcoded Strings**: Sweep `src/modules/ai/infrastructure/flows/` and replace all hardcoded model strings (e.g., `'ollama/gemma:2b'`) with constants from `@/modules/ai/domain/constants/AiModels`.\n- **Model Mapping Verification**: Cross-reference `AiModels.ts` with the actual models available on the Ollama server to ensure constants are accurate.\n\n## 3. Next.js 15 'use server' Compliance\n- **Flow Export Pattern**: Update all files in `src/modules/ai/infrastructure/flows/` to remove `export` from `ai.defineFlow` and instead export an `async function` wrapper.\n- **Example**:\n  ```typescript\n  // From:\n  export const myFlow = ai.defineFlow(...)\n  \n  // To:\n  const myFlow = ai.defineFlow(...)\n  export async function myFlowWrapper(input) { return myFlow(input); }\n  ```\n\n## 4. Domain Entity Standardization\n- **Agent Entity**: Verify `Agent.ts` implements `toProperties()`, `toStateObject()`, and `withProps()`.\n- **ID Generation**: Ensure IDs are passed from the application/repository layer and not implicitly generated in constructors.\n\n## 5. Dependency Injection & Infrastructure Purity\n- **DI Resolution**: Audit `AgentApiClient.ts` and `use-agent-store.ts` to ensure all services are resolved via `container.resolve`.\n- **Metadata Initialization**: Verify `reflect-metadata` is correctly handled in `instrumentation.ts`.\n\n## 6. Cleanup & Verification\n- **Stale Imports**: Perform a final sweep for any references to the retired `src/lib` directory.\n- **Type Checking**: Run `npm run typecheck` to ensure zero regressions.\n"}, "tool_call_id": "pyd_ai_9de12912e5ca4ad3b094ed4b5887ac69", "id": null, "provider_name": "google-vertex", "provider_details": {"thought_signature": ""}, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
